  "goodToKnow": "Die Abschrift is a copy or transcript of a document: eine beglaubigte Abschrift (certified copy), often required for job and university applications. Before printing, monks made handwritten Abschriften of texts. Abschreiben means to copy, also to cheat by copying in school, and to write off a debt or a person. Plural: die Abschriften."
